libdaq
------------------------------------------
LibDAQ is a pluggable abstraction layer for interacting with a data source
(traditionally a network interface or network data plane). Applications using
LibDAQ use the library API defined in daq.h to load, configure, and interact
with pluggable DAQ modules.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libdaq-devel-3.0.28-1bl1
  libdaq3-3.0.28-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcmocka-devel-2.0.2-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/snort3/libdaq

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/snort3/libdaq/archive/refs/tags/v3.0.28.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libdaq-3.0.28-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libdaq-3.0.28-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libdaq-3.0.28-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdaq-3.0.28-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdaq3-3.0.28-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdaq-devel-3.0.28-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libdaq)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libdaq.README
  /usr/share/doc/libdaq/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libdaq/ChangeLog-2.x
  /usr/share/doc/libdaq/ChangeLog.md
  /usr/share/doc/libdaq/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libdaq/README.md

(libdaq3)
  /usr/bin/cygdaq-3.dll

(libdaq-devel)
  /usr/include/daq.h
  /usr/include/daq_common.h
  /usr/include/daq_dlt.h
  /usr/include/daq_module_api.h
  /usr/include/daq_version.h
  /usr/lib/libdaq.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libdaq.pc

